WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:13.722
The Wand holds
an unfathomable power.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.891
If a man cloaked in light wields it,

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:19.644
the world shall be brightly lit.

00:00:20.311 --> 00:00:23.314
But if a man cloaked in darkness
brandishes it,

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:26.443
the world shall be covered
in darkness.

00:00:28.653 --> 00:00:29.654
Fire!

00:00:30.447 --> 00:00:33.450
The Dark Lord is currently
in a deep sleep.

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:36.327
To wake him,
it would require the Wand.

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:37.912
I'm hiring you with this.

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:40.373
Hey girl, why don't you hire me?

00:00:40.915 --> 00:00:43.877
You're the first orc I've met
who shows proper manners.

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:48.173
And you're a human,
but you don't seem to show any.

00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:50.967
My girl!

00:00:52.469 --> 00:00:54.304
Master Koketsu, why?

00:00:56.890 --> 00:01:00.185
Izou, you made a promise to Sonya.
You'll keep it, won't you?

00:01:02.771 --> 00:01:03.897
You can see it too,

00:01:03.938 --> 00:01:06.900
the light and darkness.

00:01:11.112 --> 00:01:13.490
You're losing your mind

00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:15.950
over a mere runaway elf girl.

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:17.202
Why?

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:18.828
Because I made a promise.

00:01:24.667 --> 00:01:25.627
Izou!

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:31.216
Izou!

